{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55826","headline":"代迁客吟鹧鸪诗 · 陈文亮","name":"代迁客吟鹧鸪诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"毛羽锦生光，江南是你乡。\n四山声欲合，迁客路犹长。\n相应隈丛竹，低飞近夕阳。\n就中汨罗岸，非细断人膓。\n（同前。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈文亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55826.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55826","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}